==English==

===Etymology===
Cf. Danish {{term|skvætte}}(rare)/{{term|skvatte||to splash}} (nominalised: {{term|skvæt}}), Icelandic {{term|skvetta||to squirt}}, Norwegian bokmål {{term|skvette}}.<ref>{{R:Webster 1913|squander}}</ref>

